# Format: <type>(<scope>): <one-line description>
# Example (single scope): feat(apps/web): add keyboard shortcut for project switcher
# Example (multi scope): feat(apps/web,packages/db): add task filters with db support
#
# Allowed types:
# feat, fix, docs, style, refactor, perf, test, build, ci, chore, revert
#
# Allowed scopes:
# apps/web, apps/api, apps/ios, packages/db, packages/ai, repo, docs, tooling, monorepo
#
# Body is required and should include implementation/execution details.

